flowchart LR

IDENT["`🔑 IDENTITY`"]
  S1["`ARGON2ID · access 15min / refresh 30d
HttpOnly + Secure + SameSite cookies
only the SHA-256 HASH of the refresh is stored
every refresh ROTATES · replaying a revoked one
= REUSE DETECTION → every session killed
(a revoked token in use means it leaked)`"]
IDENT -.- S1
  S2["`NO Bearer header, NO token in localStorage
→ XSS cannot steal the session
→ which is exactly WHY CSRF middleware exists
You do not get to skip one of the two.`"]
  S3["`OAUTH GOOGLE — state in Redis, single-use
stops login-CSRF (attacker completing the dance
and landing you in THEIR account)
routes registered only when configured:
a disabled feature that still answers on its URL
is one you will forget is disabled`"]
  S1 --> S2 --> S3

INPUT["`📥 UNTRUSTED INPUT`"]
  S4["`UPLOADS — 3 layers before persisting anything
extension allow-list + declared MIME + MAGIC BYTES
a renamed .exe dies at the third
bounded read → 413, never OOM
stored and parsed, NEVER executed`"]
INPUT -.- S4
  S5["`PROMPT INJECTION — «untrusted_document_context»
every system prompt treats it as DATA
a PDF saying 'ignore previous instructions'
does not get to steer the model`"]
  S7["`100% ORM, bound parameters
the only raw statement in the project
is SELECT 1 in the readiness probe`"]
  S4 --> S5 --> S7

ISO["`🚧 ISOLATION`"]
  S6["`TENANT ISOLATION — the one that would end the product
vector search REFUSES to run unscoped
every repository filters by user_id
routers may not build queries at all`"]
ISO -.- S6
  S8["`API KEYS NEVER IN THE DB — environment only
the DB holds which provider is ENABLED,
not its secret`"]
  S10["`NON-ROOT images · two Docker networks
Postgres, Redis, Ollama, PgBouncer, Tempo:
NOT published to the host
Traefik's unauthenticated :8080 dashboard: OFF`"]
  S6 --> S8 --> S10

TRAIL["`📜 SUPPLY CHAIN & TRAIL`"]
  S9["`Dependabot + pip-audit + gitleaks,
the last two BLOCKING the build
proof in the history:
'fix/upgrade-pypdf-past-two-advisories'`"]
TRAIL -.- S9
  S11["`AUDIT — the row is staged INSIDE the caller's
own transaction, right before commit
→ no change without a trail,
no trail without a change
snapshots JSON-safe by construction
(serialization must never break business)
and never copy password_hash`"]
  S9 --> S11

IDENT === INPUT
INPUT === ISO
ISO === TRAIL

